  "subject": "fix(metal1): shorten the KEDA ClusterExtension name (#2038)",
  "body": "OLM v1 (4.22) stores an install as Secret sh.helm.release.v1.<name>.v1 and puts that name in a\nlabel (max 63 bytes); openshift-custom-metrics-autoscaler-operator (44 chars) made it fail with\n'must be no more than 63 bytes'. Renamed to keda.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n"
}
